      <p class="text-xs text-hacker-dim leading-relaxed">The full C1 Advanced pack includes 5 complete exams with all 8 parts — including Part 4 with authentic Key Word Transformation questions, answer keys, and analysis of which structure each question targets.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
